===Organization and specialty plates===
Beginning in 2000, the Arkansas Game and Fish Commission has released one wildlife-themed plate design each year,<ref>[http://www.agfc.com/education-class/license_plates.aspx] {{webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20080911182151/http://www.agfc.com/education-class/license_plates.aspx|date=September 11, 2008}}</ref> to be issued for one calendar year, although remaining stock is sometimes issued past the end of a particular plate design's year of release. Note that some plates that were originally issued without prefixes now have them, and that prefixes now include {{small|'''G'''/'''F'''}}, {{small|'''G'''/'''G'''}} and {{small|'''G'''/'''H'''}}.

